        "source_line": 125,
        "source_line_text": "| **HIL-FR-35** | Reverse Substance GateはR0 evidence map、R1 observed contracts、R2 as-is design/test、R3 intent hypothesis＋PO検証、R4 gap/routingをstage別schemaで検査し、空、placeholder、同文、同digest、対象obligation未被覆、根拠なし`no finding`を拒否する。 | phase assertion、coverage、content digest、substance failure code |",
